        questionTextNepali: "Critical Section समस्या के हो? यसको मान्य समाधानका लागि आवश्यक तीन सर्तहरू (Mutual Exclusion, Progress, Bounded Waiting) व्याख्या गर्नुहोस्।",
        options: null,
        marks: 5,
        marksBreakdown: "5",
        answer: "### English Model Answer\n1. Critical Section Concept: A code segment in a cooperating program where shared resources (shared variables, memory buffers, banking balance variables) are accessed and updated.\n2. Three Mandatory Requirements:\n• Mutual Exclusion: If process P is executing in its critical section, no other process can be executing in its critical section simultaneously.\n• Progress: If no process is executing in its critical section and some processes wish to enter, only those processes not executing in their remainder sections can participate in deciding who enters next, and this decision cannot be postponed indefinitely.\n• Bounded Waiting: There must be a bound on the number of times other processes are allowed to enter their critical sections after a process has made a request to enter.\n\n### नेपाली नमूना उत्तर (Nepali Model Answer)\n१. Critical Section को अवधारणा: प्रोग्रामको यस्तो भाग जहाँ साझा डाटा वा बैंकको खाता ब्यालेन्स जस्ता साझा स्रोतहरू अपडेट गरिन्छ। एकै पटक धेरै प्रोसेस पस्दा डाटा बिग्रने जोखिम हुन्छ।\n२. समाधानका तीन अनिवार्य सर्तहरू:\n• Mutual Exclusion: एउटा प्रोसेस क्रिटिकल सेक्सनभित्र हुँदा अर्को कुनै पनि प्रोसेस पस्न नपाउने।\n• Progress: कोही पनि भित्र नभएको बेला भित्र जान चाहने प्रोसेसहरू बीच मात्र तुरुन्त निर्णय हुनुपर्ने।\n• Bounded Waiting: पालो पर्खिरहेको प्रोसेसले निश्चित समयभित्र प्रवेश पाउने ग्यारेन्टी हुनुपर्ने।",
