        questionTextNepali: "स्पष्ट सिन्ट्याक्स र Effective Address सूत्र सहित प्रमुख CPU एड्रेसिङ मोडहरू व्याख्या गर्नुहोस्।",
        options: null,
        marks: 5,
        marksBreakdown: "5",
        answer: "### English Model Answer\n1. Concept: Define how the CPU calculates the Effective Address (EA) of an operand.\n\n2. Major Modes:\n• Immediate Mode: Operand is specified directly in instruction (`MOV AX, 100`). No memory access.\n• Direct Addressing: Address field contains the memory address directly (`EA = Address`). `MOV AX, [5000H]`.\n• Indirect Addressing: Address field points to memory location containing the actual operand address (`EA = [Address]`).\n• Register Mode: Operand resides in a CPU register (`MOV AX, BX`). Fastest access.\n• Indexed Addressing: Effective address is generated by adding an index register to a base address (`EA = Base + Index`). Essential for traversing database arrays.\n\n### नेपाली नमूना उत्तर (Nepali Model Answer)\n१. एड्रेसिङ मोडको अवधारणा: निर्देशनमा रहेको डाटा कुन स्थानबाट प्राप्त गर्ने भन्ने विधिलाई एड्रेसिङ मोड भनिन्छ।\n\n२. प्रमुख प्रकारहरू:\n• Immediate Mode: डाटा निर्देशनमै दिइएको हुन्छ (MOV AX, 100)।\n• Direct Addressing: निर्देशनसँगै मेमोरीको वास्तविक ठेगाना दिइएको हुन्छ (EA = Address)।\n• Indirect Addressing: दिइएको ठेगानाले अर्को ठेगाना देखाउँछ जहाँ डाटा हुन्छ (EA = [Address])।\n• Register Mode: डाटा रजिस्टरभित्रै रहेको हुन्छ (MOV AX, BX)।\n• Indexed Addressing: बेस ठेगानामा इन्डेक्स मान जोडेर ठेगाना निकालिन्छ (EA = Base + Index)।",
