      ModelQuestion(
        number: 7,
        questionText: "Explain Direct Memory Access (DMA). Detail the internal architecture of a DMA Controller (DMAC) and compare Programmed I/O, Interrupt-Driven I/O, and DMA.",
        questionTextNepali: "Direct Memory Access (DMA) व्याख्या गर्नुहोस्। DMA कन्ट्रोलरको आन्तरिक संरचना स्पष्ट गर्दै Programmed I/O, Interrupt-Driven I/O र DMA बीच तुलना गर्नुहोस्।",
        options: null,
        marks: 10,
        marksBreakdown: "10",
        answer: "### English Model Answer\n1. DMA Architecture: Specialized co-processor allowing peripherals to transfer data directly to/from memory over system buses without CPU mediation.\n\n2. Internal Architecture of DMAC: Address Register (tracks source/destination memory address), Word Count Register (tracks remaining bytes), Control Register (mode, direction), Status Register, Bus Request (BR) and Bus Grant (BG) logic.\n\n3. Comparative Analysis:\n• Programmed I/O: CPU sits in a tight busy-waiting loop checking device status flags. Wastes 99% of CPU cycles.\n• Interrupt-Driven I/O: Device generates hardware interrupt when ready; CPU services byte-by-byte. Efficient for low-speed peripherals (keyboard), but incurs high interrupt overhead for large blocks.\n• DMA: CPU only initializes transfer parameters; DMAC autonomously streams multi-megabyte disk/network blocks at bus speed and issues one final interrupt upon completion.\n\n### नेपाली नमूना उत्तर (Nepali Model Answer)\n१. DMA को अवधारणा: बाह्य उपकरणहरूले CPU को संलग्नता बिना सिधै मुख्य मेमोरी (RAM) सँग तीव्र गतिमा डाटा आदानप्रदान गर्ने प्रविधि।\n\n२. DMA कन्ट्रोलरका मुख्य अङ्गहरू: एड्रेस रजिस्टर, वर्ड काउन्ट रजिस्टर (बाँकी डाटा गन्ने), कन्ट्रोल रजिस्टर र बस अनुरोध/अनुमति प्रणाली।\n\n३. तुलना:\n• Programmed I/O: उपकरण तयार छ कि छैन भनी CPU ले लगातार कुरिरहन्छ, जसले गर्दा समय खेर जान्छ।\n• Interrupt-Driven I/O: उपकरण तयार हुनासाथ इन्टरप्ट पठाउँछ। साना कामका लागि उपयुक्त तर ठूलो डाटामा ढिलो हुन्छ।\n• DMA: CPU ले सुरुको आदेश दिएपछि पूरै डाटा ट्रान्सफर DMA आफैँले सम्पन्न गर्छ र अन्त्यमा मात्र जानकारी गराउँछ।",
