        answer: "### English Model Answer\n1. Social Engineering: Manipulating human psychology rather than exploiting technical software bugs to trick victims into divulging sensitive credentials.\n2. Attack Vectors:\n• Phishing: Mass untargeted fraudulent emails impersonating banks to harvest credit card numbers and passwords.\n• Spear Phishing: Highly personalized fraudulent emails tailored to specific individuals using customized corporate knowledge.\n• Whaling: Spear phishing directed at executive leaders (CEO, Chief Financial Officer) to authorize wire transfers.\n• Vishing: Voice telephone fraud impersonating bank staff to coax customers into revealing OTP codes.\n3. Defense Mechanisms: Mandatory multi-factor authentication (FIDO2 keys), DomainKeys Identified Mail (DKIM/DMARC), email sandboxing, and continuous customer awareness campaigns.\n\n### नेपाली नमूना उत्तर (Nepali Model Answer)\n१. सोसियल इन्जिनियरिङ: कम्प्युटरको कमजोरीभन्दा मानिसको सोझोपन वा डर-त्रासको फाइदा उठाएर पासवर्ड चोर्ने प्रविधि।\n२. प्रकारहरू:\n• Phishing: बैंकको नाममा नक्कली इमेल पठाएर पासवर्ड माग्ने।\n• Spear Phishing: निश्चित व्यक्तिलाई लक्षित गरी पठाइने व्यक्तिगत इमेल।\n• Whaling: बैंकका उच्च अधिकारी (CEO/CFO) लाई लक्षित गरी ठूलो रकम ट्रान्सफर गराउने ठगी।\n• Vishing: फोन कल गरेर बैंक कर्मचारी हुँ भन्दै ओटीपी माग्ने ठगी।\n३. सुरक्षा: दुई-तहको प्रमाणीकरण (2FA), सुरक्षित इमेल फिल्टरिङ, र ग्राहकलाई सचेतना फैलाउने।",
