        answer: "### English Model Answer\n1. Server Virtualization: Abstracts physical computer hardware into multiple isolated Virtual Machines (VMs) with independent operating systems.\n2. Comparison:\n• Type-1 (Bare-Metal) Hypervisor: Installs directly on physical server hardware (e.g., VMware ESXi, KVM, Nutanix AHV). Delivers maximum I/O performance, hardware direct access, and zero OS overhead. Mandatory for enterprise core banking servers.\n• Type-2 (Hosted) Hypervisor: Executes as an application on top of an existing host OS (e.g., VMware Workstation, VirtualBox). Higher CPU/memory overhead; used for software testing and development.\n\n### नेपाली नमूना उत्तर (Nepali Model Answer)\n१. सर्भर भर्चुअलाइजेसन: एउटै भौतिक सर्भरभित्र धेरै वटा भर्चुअल कम्प्युटरहरू (VM) चलाउने प्रविधि।\n२. तुलना:\n• Type-1 (Bare-Metal): सिधै हार्डवेयरमा इन्स्टल हुने (VMware ESXi, KVM)। अत्यन्त छिटो, सुरक्षित र बैंकका मुख्य सर्भरहरूका लागि अनिवार्य।\n• Type-2 (Hosted): सामान्य अपरेटिङ सिस्टमभित्र सफ्टवेयरको रूपमा चल्ने (VirtualBox)। परीक्षणका लागि मात्र उपयुक्त।",
