        answer: "### English Model Answer\n1. Internal Registers: High-speed temporary storage cells situated inside CPU silicon operating at clock frequency.\n2. Roles:\n• Program Counter (PC): Holds memory address of next instruction to be fetched.\n• Memory Address Register (MAR): Holds address in memory currently being read from or written to.\n• Memory Buffer Register (MBR): Holds data read from or waiting to be written to memory.\n• Instruction Register (IR): Holds the operational opcode currently being decoded.\n• Accumulator (AC): Temporary register storing operands and immediate results of ALU arithmetic.\n• Program Status Word (PSW): Holds status condition flags (Zero Flag, Carry Flag, Sign Flag, Overflow Flag, Interrupt Enable).\n\n### नेपाली नमूना उत्तर (Nepali Model Answer)\n१. आन्तरिक रजिस्टरको भूमिका: प्रोसेसरभित्र रहेका उच्च गतिको अस्थायी भण्डारण एकाइहरू।\n२. प्रमुख रजिस्टरहरू:\n• PC: अर्को पढिने निर्देशनको ठेगाना राख्छ।\n• MAR: पढ्न वा लेख्न लागिएको मेमोरी ठेगाना राख्छ।\n• MBR: मेमोरीबाट आएको वा जान लागेको वास्तविक डाटा राख्छ।\n• IR: हाल प्रोसेस भइरहेको निर्देशन राख्छ।\n• AC (Accumulator): गणितीय हिसाबको नतिजा अस्थायी रूपमा राख्छ।\n• PSW: हिसाबको नतिजाका फ्ल्यागहरू (Zero, Carry, Sign) राख्छ।",
