        questionTextNepali: "वाणिज्य बैंकमा SIEM र Security Operations Center (SOC) को आर्किटेक्चर व्याख्या गर्नुहोस्।",
        options: null,
        marks: 5,
        marksBreakdown: "5",
        answer: "### English Model Answer\n1. Security Operations Center (SOC): The dedicated organizational unit (personnel, processes, and technology) continuously monitoring, detecting, analyzing, and responding to cybersecurity incidents.\n2. SIEM Platform Architecture:\n• Data Ingestion: Aggregates event logs from firewalls, routers, Windows Active Directory, Linux servers, CBS databases, and endpoint antiviruses via Syslog/agents.\n• Normalization & Correlation Engine: Parses disparate log formats into unified telemetry and correlates multi-source events (e.g., failed login on VPN followed by unusual database export).\n• Alerting & Threat Intelligence: Integrates global threat feeds (IOCs) and escalates security incidents to SOC Tier 1/2 analysts.\n• Compliance Archival: Securely stores cryptographically hashed audit trails for mandatory 180+ days per regulatory standards.\n\n### नेपाली नमूना उत्तर (Nepali Model Answer)\n१. SOC (Security Operations Center): बैंकको डिजिटल प्रणालीहरूमा चौबीसै घण्टा निगरानी राख्ने, आक्रमण पहिचान गर्ने र तुरुन्तै रोक्ने प्राविधिक टोली र कक्ष।\n२. SIEM को भूमिका: बैंकका सम्पूर्ण कम्प्युटर, सर्भर र फायरवालका लग (Logs) फाइलहरूलाई एकै ठाउँमा संकलन गरी विश्लेषण गर्ने सफ्टवेयर।\n३. कार्यप्रणाली: जब धेरै ठाउँमा एकै पटक शंकास्पद गतिविधि देखिन्छ, SIEM ले तत्काल अलर्ट जारी गर्छ र सुरक्षा टोलीले आक्रमणकारीलाई प्रणालीबाट बाहिर निकालिदिन्छ।",
