      ModelQuestion(
        number: 5,
        questionText: "Explain Error Detection and Correction techniques in data communication: Parity Check, Checksum, and Cyclic Redundancy Check (CRC).",
        questionTextNepali: "डाटा कम्युनिकेसनमा Error Detection र Correction प्रविधिहरू (Parity, Checksum, CRC) व्याख्या गर्नुहोस्।",
        options: null,
        marks: 5,
        marksBreakdown: "5",
        answer: "### English Model Answer\n1. Error Control: Mechanisms ensuring frames received across noisy communication links match transmitted payloads.\n2. Techniques:\n• Parity Check: Appends a single parity bit (even or odd parity). Detects only single-bit errors; fails completely on even-bit errors.\n• Internet Checksum: 16-bit one's complement sum of header words used in IPv4 and TCP/UDP. Detects multi-bit errors, but weak against burst errors.\n• Cyclic Redundancy Check (CRC): Polynomial binary division (`CRC-32`). Generates a mathematical remainder appended to frame. Detects all single and double-bit errors, odd-number bit errors, and burst errors up to polynomial degree.\n\n### नेपाली नमूना उत्तर (Nepali Model Answer)\n१. एरर कन्ट्रोलको अवधारणा: तार वा नेटवर्कबाट डाटा पठाउँदा बाटोमा डाटा बिग्रियो कि बिग्रिएन भनी पत्ता लगाउने प्रविधि।\n२. प्रविधिहरू:\n• Parity Check: अन्त्यमा १ बिट थपेर जोड वा विजोर संख्या मिलाउने। सरल तर १ बिट गल्ती मात्र पत्ता लगाउँछ।\n• Checksum: संख्याहरूको जोड निकालेर अन्त्यमा पठाउने (TCP/IP मा प्रयोग हुने)।\n• Cyclic Redundancy Check (CRC): गणितीय बहुपदीय भाग (Polynomial Division) विधि। अत्यन्त शक्तिशाली र नेटवर्कमा सबैभन्दा बढी प्रयोग हुने।",
