      ModelQuestion(
        number: 8,
        questionText: "Classify Firewalls (Packet Filtering, Stateful Inspection, Proxy, and Next-Generation Firewalls - NGFW). Discuss how defense-in-depth protects banking network perimeters.",
        questionTextNepali: "फायरवालहरूको वर्गीकरण गर्नुहोस् (Packet Filtering, Stateful, Proxy, NGFW)। Defense-in-depth रणनीतिले बैंकको नेटवर्कलाई कसरी सुरक्षित राख्दछ, चर्चा गर्नुहोस्।",
        options: null,
        marks: 10,
        marksBreakdown: "10",
        answer: "### English Model Answer\n1. Firewall Classification:\n• Packet Filtering (Stateless): Evaluates individual packets against static IP/Port rules in isolation. Vulnerable to IP spoofing.\n• Stateful Inspection: Tracks state of active TCP connections in a state table. Drops unexpected unsolicited packets.\n• Application Proxy Firewall: Terminates connection, inspects payload at Layer 7, and regenerates a clean outbound request.\n• Next-Generation Firewall (NGFW): Deep Packet Inspection (DPI) incorporating application awareness, integrated Intrusion Prevention System (IPS), SSL/TLS decryption, and real-time threat intelligence feeds.\n\n2. Defense-in-Depth Strategy in Banks:\nLayered concentric rings of security: Perimeter NGFW -> DMZ containing web proxies -> Internal Firewall protecting CBS -> Host-based Endpoint Detection & Response (EDR) -> Database Activity Monitoring (DAM) with strict multi-factor authentication.\n\n### नेपाली नमूना उत्तर (Nepali Model Answer)\n१. फायरवालको वर्गीकरण:\n• Packet Filtering: IP ठेगाना र पोर्ट नम्बर मात्र हेरेर अनुमति दिने प्रारम्भिक प्रणाली।\n• Stateful Inspection: चालु कनेक्सनहरूको अवस्था (State Table) निगरानी गरी आधिकारिक प्याकेट मात्र भित्र छिर्न दिने।\n• Application Proxy: डाटालाई लेयर ७ सम्म खोलेर गहिरो परीक्षण गर्ने।\n• Next-Generation Firewall (NGFW): आधुनिक एप्लिकेसन पहिचान, एकीकृत भाइरस तथा इन्ट्रुजन रोकथाम (IPS), र इन्क्रिप्टेड डाटा परीक्षण गर्न सक्ने अत्याधुनिक फायरवाल।\n\n२. Defense-in-Depth रणनीति:\nकुनै एउटा सुरक्षा घेरा तोडिए पनि अर्को घेराले रोक्न सक्ने गरी बहु-तहको सुरक्षा (पेरिमीटर फायरवाल, आन्तरिक फायरवाल, एन्टिभाइरस, डाटाबेस इन्क्रिप्सन) लागू गर्ने रणनीति।",
